# L §3.1: never is "later than every date"; a def whose `at` gives never has no law date that governs: no meaning,
# found at the key (RUN-DOMAIN, L §8.4).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input dl: date
input x: int
def c: int = x at dl

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  dl = never
  x = 1

ask q: c
=== expect
q: refused: RUN-DOMAIN ...
  cut 2026-12-31
